WEBVTT

00:13:58.989 --> 00:14:01.232
It didn't really feel like your own.

00:14:01.574 --> 00:14:03.019
So what did they do?

00:14:03.043 --> 00:14:06.289
They took the eggs and the milk
out of the powder.

00:14:06.313 --> 00:14:08.039
(Laughter)

00:14:08.063 --> 00:14:11.880
Now you had to break
the eggs and add them,

00:14:11.904 --> 00:14:15.060
you had to measure the milk
and add it, mixing it.

00:14:15.084 --> 00:14:17.917
Now it was your cake.
Now everything was fine.

00:14:17.941 --> 00:14:20.305
(Laughter)

00:14:20.329 --> 00:14:27.251
(Applause)

00:14:27.904 --> 00:14:30.133
Now, I think a little bit
like the IKEA effect,